# UC02 — ESG / Sustainability Audit

**Persona**: Sustainability lead preparing for CSRD reporting, or auditor verifying ESG disclosures.

**Scenario**: Reviewer must extract every disclosed Scope 3 category, every material topic, every quantified emissions figure from long sustainability reports — and verify against the CSRD/ESRS framework.

**Question types**:
- Exhaustive search ("list all Scope 3 categories disclosed")
- Numerical aggregation
- Multi-doc cross-reference (report vs ESRS framework)

**Sample docs**: Unilever / Ørsted / H&M sustainability reports 2024, CSRD ESRS standards as regulatory anchor.

**What this tests**: long-doc exhaustive extraction + framework alignment.
